"資料行名稱須取決於或應該取決於薪酬規則計算得出的結果，此預設設定便很有用。）"

#. module: hr_payroll
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_payroll.hr_salary_rule_form
msgid "<code>result_qty</code>: float, quantity, which defaults to 1."
msgstr "<code>result_qty</code>：浮點數，數量值，預設值為 1。"

#. module: hr_payroll
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_payroll.hr_salary_rule_form
msgid ""
"<code>result_rate</code>: float, rate between -100.0 and 100.0, which "
"defaults to 100.0 (%)."
msgstr ""
"<code>result_rate</code>：浮點數，計算比率，為介乎 −100.0 至 100.0 之間的數"
"值，預設值為 100.0 (%)。"

#. module: hr_payroll
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_payroll.hr_salary_rule_form
msgid ""
"<code>result_rules</code>: dict containing the rules amounts, quantities, "
"rates and totals (previously computed)"
msgstr ""
"<code>result_rules</code>：dict（字典），包含規則金額、數量、計算比率，以及總"
"計金額（先前計算得出）"

